# watchApp's Xcode project and Info.plist are generated by xcodegen from project.yml,
# which is the file under version control. Run `xcodegen generate` in watchApp/ after
# cloning. Tracking the generated pbxproj instead would mean constant churn and
# unmergeable conflicts on every regeneration.
watchApp/watchApp.xcodeproj/
watchApp/Info.plist
watchApp/Configuration/Version.xcconfig

